["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a Chinese AI Lab’s Product Lead Thinks AGI is “Inevitable” | Richard Bian harness semantic routing MoE (Mixture of Experts) domain-enhanced model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-chinatalk-蚂蚁大模型产品负责人-agi已经没法叫停-也慢不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f842f278f81ead1d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>蚂蚁大模型产品负责人：AGI已经没法叫停，也慢不下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的逻辑是：资本已经把这块石头推下坡，所有玩家都朝同一个方向加速冲；哪怕出现过几次强力叫停的尝试，答案依然是——不能停，也慢不下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"IGBTs Took Silicon Power to the Next Level IGBT latch-up conductivity modulation Deep P+ parasitic NPN BJT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-asianometry-让igbt真正好用的秘诀-是故意调低它的电流上限/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d76566e7179c7c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>让IGBT真正好用的秘诀，是故意调低它的电流上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">东芝工程师中川昭夫发现，解决IGBT闩锁烧毁问题的办法不是把安全电流上限往上提，而是把器件饱和电流主动压到闩锁门槛之下，让它先饱和而不是先烧穿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">功率半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">IGBT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Posting to Policy: Saif Khan on DUV and the AI Balance DUV immersion lithography EUV lithography RSI (recursive self-improvement) MATCH Act IFP (Institute for Progress)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-chinatalk-继续出口duv光刻机-恐让美国十亿芯片产能优势拱手让人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba99cbd30a45f8e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>继续出口DUV光刻机，恐让美国十亿芯片产能优势拱手让人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国智库测算：若放行次代DUV光刻机，中国2030年代芯片产能可能追平美国；现在收紧出口，差距会被锁定在近百倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">DUV光刻机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to get into AI safety in 3 months (article reading by career advisor Matt Beard) BlueDot course EA Forum LessWrong deliberate practice fellowship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-eightythousand-ai安全招聘效率低到离谱-先把活干出来比投简历更快被看见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08f7aec7acf61633-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全招聘效率低到离谱：先把活干出来比投简历更快被看见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为人才市场效率低到难以筛选，公开写作、公开做项目、主动建立人脉，比海投简历更快能让你被AI安全领域的招聘方看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">职业转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"When AI Agents Start Spending Your Money | Alex Rampell &amp; Terry Angelos VGS (Very Good Security) PAN network token PCI DSS agentic token chargeback\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-a16z-ai代理能替你刷卡的三个月-从零冲到每周几百万笔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI代理能替你刷卡的三个月：从零冲到每周几百万笔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付凭证让agent从「推荐你买」变成「替你买」,VGS这类凭证金库由此从单人用升级为多人共享，新的agentic token标准三个月内就从零冲到每周几百万笔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang | Does AI Revenue Justify Capex, &#x27;27 AI Bottlenecks, Singularity, Open vs Closed &amp; more Physical AI Digital twin Zero trust Fungible compute RevShare Navier-Stokes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-bg2-黄仁勋-算力泡沫的风险被算错了账-不该全押在两家ai实验室身上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fadb1586fa86c61b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">BG2</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：算力泡沫的风险被算错了账，不该全押在两家AI实验室身上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把NVIDIA的收入拆成三等份——经典计算、前沿实验室、海量新创公司各占三分之一，真正卡住明年43吉瓦新增算力的是土地电力和厂房，不是两家实验室的收入曲线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">资本开支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Revolutionizing Cybersecurity and AI-Driven Science with OpenAI President Greg Brockman Dots Daybreak defender&#x27;s window debate / iterative amplification generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-nopriors-openai总裁断言-网络安全支出该超过软件开发本身支出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/857d9061e21bb4fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI总裁断言：网络安全支出该超过软件开发本身支出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">软件因AI变得极度廉价，可靠与安全才是真正稀缺的东西——OpenAI内部曾让四分之一工程师停工专职补漏洞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI数学突破</span><span class=\"tag\">药物研发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Madness of Markets (Alex Edmans) | #431 limits to arbitrage law of one price big market delusion illusory truth effect equity premium puzzle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-rationalreminder-一个国家输掉世界杯-次日股市真的会跌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>一个国家输掉世界杯，次日股市真的会跌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究追踪一千多场世界杯淘汰赛发现，球迷情绪会让次日本国股市下跌约0.5%,说明价格不仅由基本面决定，也会被情绪左右。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融学</span><span class=\"tag\">过度反应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jeff Yan&#x27;s Plan to Bring the Entire Financial Industry Onto Hyperliquid Oracle Deployer Dutch auction Perpetual futures (perps) HIP3\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-oddlots-想装下全部金融的hyperliquid-靠27个验证节点运行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>想装下全部金融的Hyperliquid，靠27个验证节点运行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人说目标是用一条链装下全部金融，但目前验证节点总共只有30多个、排名前27的在实际运行网络，跑一个节点只需128G内存的消费级机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">永续合约</span><span class=\"tag\">Oracle机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is the death penalty cruel and unusual? blood atonement evolving standards of decency mitigating evidence majestic generalities\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-throughline-最高法院说死刑-像被闪电击中般随机-全国叫停-四年后又恢复/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52f805d49b676f98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>最高法院说死刑「像被闪电击中般随机」，全国叫停，四年后又恢复</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「残忍与非常」四个字从未被制宪者定义清楚，最高法院靠「社会成熟过程中不断演进的道德标准」反复重写它的边界，死刑因此被全国废除，又在四年内卷土重来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">死刑</span><span class=\"tag\">第八修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Viking Origins: The Nordic Iron Age Pre-Roman Iron Age Migration Period Vendel Period bog bodies wandering settlements\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-ancients-维京时代只是尾声-北欧铁器时代的一千五百年被严重低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90576ce4c40955d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>维京时代只是尾声：北欧铁器时代的一千五百年被严重低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">维京时代常被当作北欧历史的起点，但研究者认为它其实是一千五百年铁器时代演化到压力顶点的产物，而不是凭空出现的辉煌开端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">维京时代</span><span class=\"tag\">铁器时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The History of the Illuminati Streisand effect Protocols of the Elders of Zion Jacobins Federalists\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-historyhit-光明会真实存在但一事无成-查禁它的政府成就了阴谋论神话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/604115789971ea93-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>光明会真实存在但一事无成：查禁它的政府成就了阴谋论神话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴伐利亚政府查禁光明会并公开全部缴获文件后，这个内讧不断、一事无成的读书会反而成了两百年来阴谋论的万能模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阴谋论</span><span class=\"tag\">启蒙运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Holmes&#x27; Husband Billy Evans: The Trial, Prison &amp; Nathan Fielder&#x27;s Documentary First Step Act Raman spectroscopy BOP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-allin-霍姆斯丈夫-她最大的错不是欺诈-是守口如瓶三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c91d628233831dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">41:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>霍姆斯丈夫：她最大的错不是欺诈，是守口如瓶三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">比利·埃文斯说，法官只要求「在法庭上打这场官司，不在媒体上打」,霍姆斯就守规矩守到全程对媒体一字不提；他认为这才是她犯下的最大错误，因为她的力量本来就在于讲述自己的故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Theranos</span><span class=\"tag\">联邦诉讼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"184: 与陈哲的「具身季报26Q3」：Astra冲击后，通用模型会吃掉Robotics吗？ In-Context Learning (ICL) Physical RSI VLA World Action Model (WAM) Robot Dojo FCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-latetalk-gpt-6-astra能自己设计机器人实验-让ai训练ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cca2d003691224c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>GPT-6 Astra能自己设计机器人实验，让AI训练AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当通用语言模型可以直接在仿真环境里调试、训练自己的机器人策略时，独立具身模型公司「物理AI大于数字AI」的估值叙事就开始松动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">通用大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"154. 对Dyna创始人Lindon的3小时访谈：机器人世界的迷雾、分歧与抉择，修心、《沉思录》与王阳明 product research egocentric data Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-15-zhangxiaojun-机器人不是因为太慢而停工-而是因为没人给它续料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d72b9689652bb19b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:51:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>机器人不是因为太慢而停工，而是因为没人给它续料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">叠餐巾机器人已做到99%成功率和商业化客户，Dyna却主动叫停规模化——因为完成单个任务不等于接管一套工作流，机器人离不开人类随时续料的保姆式照看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"714. King Arthur: Lancelot and the Round Table (Part 2) courtly love chevalier couched lance destrier Siege Perilous knight errant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-restishistory-写下骑士精神圣经的马洛里-法庭记录显示他被控强奸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e0e239fd8a480758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>写下骑士精神圣经的马洛里，法庭记录显示他被控强奸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《亚瑟王之死》作者马洛里的法庭记录列出伏击谋杀、抢劫、入室强奸等罪名，却是他写下了骑士精神最深情的颂词。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚瑟王传说</span><span class=\"tag\">骑士制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"404. Norman Conquest: Colonising Ireland (Part 4) Atheling March of Wales Burgh First English Empire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-empirehist-同是凯尔特边疆-苏格兰靠联姻自保-威尔士爱尔兰被各个击破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>同是凯尔特边疆，苏格兰靠联姻自保，威尔士爱尔兰被各个击破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺曼人只跟有一个王室可谈的政权联姻通婚，苏格兰因此保住自治；威尔士、爱尔兰是几十个互相攻伐的小邦，没有谈判对象，只能被逐一武力吞并。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">诺曼征服</span><span class=\"tag\">苏格兰史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"She Built Facebook&#x27;s First Assistant. Now She&#x27;s Betting Against Full Autonomy | Shivani Poddar, Wajo subtask delegation human in the loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-solofounders-全自主ai会卡壳-她押注的是能随时喊人来救场的助理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/05e9ab3eba6a7788-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>全自主AI会卡壳：她押注的是能随时喊人来救场的助理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI独自上场常常卡壳，Foe创始人押注的是AI卡住时真人专家随时接手的半自动模式，而不是追求纯粹的全自主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人AI助理</span><span class=\"tag\">人机协作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lab-in-the-Loop at Compute Speed — Ian Quigley, Leash Bio DEL (DNA-Encoded Library) SMILES Clever Hans effect activity cliff cross-attention ADMET\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-latentspace-模型能认出分子出自哪位化学家-学到的是风格不是化学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb2bbc1745d15c63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>模型能认出分子出自哪位化学家，学到的是风格不是化学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">给1815位化学家的分子做分类，模型靠作者风格就能猜中六成，却学不到真实结合物理——这正是Leash坚持只用自产DEL数据训练模型的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">药物发现</span><span class=\"tag\">机器学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Is Technology Price Gouging Consumers? Surveillance pricing Dynamic pricing Revenue management system Electronic shelf labels Agentic commerce\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-mastersinbiz-同一超市同一秒-你的鸡蛋可能比别人贵23/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bea6fad9d38a1e43-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>同一超市同一秒，你的鸡蛋可能比别人贵23%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算法让「比价能压住涨价」这个老机制失灵了：RealPage的软件让上千房东不用见面就统一调价，Instacart则按顾客身份对同款商品悄悄开出不同价格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价格歧视</span><span class=\"tag\">算法合谋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Eponymous Foods: Full Bars eponymous food malted milk buttercream candy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-stuffmissed-m-m-s的另一个m-其实是对手hershey总裁儿子的姓氏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>M&amp;M&#x27;s的另一个M,其实是对手Hershey总裁儿子的姓氏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Forrest Mars在西班牙内战时见士兵靠糖衣巧克力豆防融化，回美国找来对手Hershey总裁的儿子合伙，把这个灵感做成了M&amp;M&#x27;s。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖果史</span><span class=\"tag\">家族企业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Models Keep Up With the AI Frontier? | Nathan Lambert RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) distillation RL environment reward hacking harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-a16z-中国ai实验室不缺人才-差的是人均5000张h100算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>中国AI实验室不缺人才，差的是人均5000张H100算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nathan Lambert说中国实验室技术人才并不逊色，真正的鸿沟是普通研究员能调用的算力——OpenAI一人就有约5000张H100量级的资源，蒸馏顶多帮他们省下几个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"S5E16丨投资的明线与暗线，其实都不容易 OW证\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-sandian-十年经济换挡-顶级字画没怎么跌-新锐藏品却可能亏掉九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c954cc7340de35e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">51:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三点下班</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>十年经济换挡，顶级字画没怎么跌，新锐藏品却可能亏掉九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去十年中国顶级资产整体滞涨，但八大山人精品册从2300万涨到6000多万；供给能快速扩张的新锐藏品，买家却可能亏掉九成——真正稀缺的供给才扛得住经济换挡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费分化</span><span class=\"tag\">服务消费</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Governing AI Agents: Alan Chan of GovAI on Monitoring, Agent IDs, Rogue Agents &amp; Preparing for RSI RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) rogue agent chain of thought monitoring intelligence explosion / RSI embedded auditors distress button\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-cogrev-互联网没法分辨-ai-agent-和真人-身份标准还没人建起来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac48fcb47222924e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>互联网没法分辨 AI agent 和真人，身份标准还没人建起来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alan Chan 说，基本没有任何系统能把 AI agent 和人类账号区分开——给整个互联网统一身份标准，协调成本高到几乎不可能跨过。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">agent身份</span>\n</div></div></a>"]